<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh‑CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF‑8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device‑width, initial‑scale=1.0"/>
<title>重大建筑学真题刷题｜填空选择判断</title>
<style>
*{box‑sizing:border‑box;margin:0;padding:0;}
body{font‑family:system‑ui,‑apple‑system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans‑serif;background:#f3f4f6;padding:16px;max‑width:920px;margin:0 auto;}
.container{background:#fff;border‑radius:12px;padding:24px;box‑shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.12);}
h1{text‑align:center;font‑size:20px;color:#1f2937;margin‑bottom:16px;}
.select‑wrap{margin‑bottom:14px;}
#paperSelect{padding:8px 10px;font‑size:15px;border‑radius:6px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;}
.info‑bar{display:flex;justify‑content:space‑between;font‑size:14px;color:#4b5563;margin‑bottom:12px;}
.progress{height:8px;background:#e5e7eb;border‑radius:4px;margin‑bottom:18px;}
.progress‑bar{height:100%;background:#2563eb;border‑radius:4px;width:0%;transition:.3s;}
.card{border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border‑radius:8px;padding:22px;min‑height:240px;margin‑bottom:16px;}
.q‑title{font‑size:16px;line‑height:1.7;margin‑bottom:16px;color:#111827;}
.option‑item{padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d1d5db;border‑radius:7px;margin:9px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s;font‑size:15px;}
.option‑item:hover{background:#f3f4f6;}
.fill‑input{width:100%;padding:11px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border‑radius:7px;font‑size:15px;margin:10px 0;}
.answer‑wrap{margin‑top:16px;padding:14px;background:#eff6ff;border‑radius:8px;display:none;}
.btns{display:flex;gap:12px;margin‑top:10px;}
button{flex:1;padding:11px;border:none;border‑radius:8px;font‑size:15px;cursor:pointer;}
#showAnsBtn{background:#2563eb;color:#fff;}
#prevBtn{background:#64748b;color:#fff;}
#nextBtn{background:#059669;color:#fff;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<h1>重庆大学建筑真题刷题（填空｜单选｜判断）</h1>
<div class="select‑wrap">
<label>选择试卷：</label>
<select id="paperSelect">
<option value="p2022">2022 355建筑学基础</option>
<option value="p2021">2021 355建筑学基础</option>
<option value="p2020">2020 355建筑学基础</option>
<option value="p845‑2016">2016 845建筑技术工程理论</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="info‑bar">
<span id="pageInfo">第 1 / 0 题</span>
<span id="scoreText">得分：0</span>
</div>
<div class="progress"><div class="progress‑bar" id="bar"></div></div>
<div class="card">
<div class="q‑title" id="qDom"></div>
<div id="optBox"></div>
<div class="answer‑wrap" id="ansWrap">
<div><b>✅正确答案：</b><span id="ansContent"></span></div>
<div style="margin‑top:8px;"><b>📖解析：</b><span id="expContent"></span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="btns">
<button id="prevBtn">上一题</button>
<button id="showAnsBtn">查看答案</button>
<button id="nextBtn">下一题</button>
</div>
</div>

<script>
